<!-- Secção Sobre mim -->
<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="inline-heading">
            <h2>About</h2>
        </div>
        <p>I’m a Service and UX/UI Designer based in Lisbon. I’m currently studying at the Faculty of Fine Arts
            (University of Lisbon) and previously specialised in UX/UI at EDIT.</p>
        <p>Today at ARTE — the agency redesigning Portugal's public digital services — I work on platforms that scale to
            millions. Before that: film industry, media monitoring, nonprofits. Different contexts, same question: how
            can we design solutions that are useful, clear, and authentic?</p>
        <p>Download my <a href="assets/Andreia_Valdez_CV_2026.pdf" target="_blank" onclick="CV()" class="button">CV</a></p>
</section>
